  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgDevCo Ventures Plus - Design Phase Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second phase of design costs for a programme which will target early-stage investment into small and medium sized enterprises in the African agriculture sector requiring between $1m and $4m to scale-up their activities.
This is the second component created on this, as payments cannot be made on the old component due to the programme changing phase.</narrative>
  </description>
